.
.  Macro to generate plot of residuals versus time
.
device 1 x11
device 2 postscript
.
thickness 0.15
tic mark label size 3
label case asis
label size 3
x3label size 4
x3label Figure 2.8
.
read x y
1 1.0
2 1.5
2 0.9
2 0.7
2 0.6
2 -0.2
2 -0.5
2 -0.7
2 -0.8
3 2.4
3 1.1
3 0.3
3 0.2
3 0.1
3 -0.1
3 -0.4
3 -0.5
3 -0.6
3 -0.6
3 -1.1
3 -1.3
3 -1.5
3 -1.7
4 1.7
4 0.8
4 0.6
4 0.2
4 -0.6
4 -0.8
4 -1.0
4 -1.4
5 1.9
end of data
.
xlimits 1 5
xtic offset 0.3 0.3
label case asis
x1label Factor Level
y1label Residuals
char box
line blank
plot y x
limits freeze
pre-erase off
.
loop for k = 1 1 5
   let atemp = mean y subset x = k
   let xmean(k) = k
   let ymean(k) = atemp
end of loop
line solid
char blank
plot ymean xmean
.
device 2 close
.
system cp dppl1f.dat resx1.ps
.
